STR_OBG_DESCRIPTION_CLASSIC           :Kohinga whakairoiro toi tongi mātāmua o OpenGFX2 mō OpenTTD, tangongitanga taketake (topa māori 8bpp). Kei te wātea noa i ngā ture o te GNU General Public License, whakaputanga 2+. [{STRING}]
